Description: Wild OS controls, the shared QML module WildOS.UI
 The buttons, switches, check boxes, fields, drop-downs, menus, tabs,
 title bars, rows, cards, dialogs and icons every Wild OS app, panel
 widget and system screen draws, in one place so they look and behave
 the same everywhere. Colours follow the accent and the dark or light
 scheme chosen in Settings, and text follows the system text size.
 .
 It also carries the window frame helper for apps that draw their own
 title bar (shadow, blur, moving and resizing) and a gallery that shows
 every control in every state.
